msgid ""
"- [ ] Listed representative commercial licenses already purchased internally.\n"
"- [ ] Listed prohibited source-available or dual-licensed software.\n"
"- [ ] Documented licenses requiring special review procedures.\n"
"- [ ] Created dedicated usage guides for frequently used dual-licensed software."
msgstr ""

